  "presentation_amendment": "Presentation amended 2026-10-26 by the owner (goals C7), after the planned result was read and without changing any metric, rule or field: the scene shows both changes the source reports and the plan recorded before measurement. The opening comparison stays the nucleolar mean 5-EU (its directions do not match the source); the nucleolar eccentricity, planned as the second readout, is saved as a companion comparison beside it. The build checks each recorded direction against the scene's text (direction_checks) and stops when they disagree. The source's EU/NPM1 per nucleolus is not added after the fact.",
